\pard\plain \sl288\slmult1\ltrch\loch {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 Mandri no longer saw a girl trained in the art of woman-standing-still, he saw a person. }
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8220\'93You\u8217\'92re a thin veneer lidding a black pit of shame.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 Lora laughed and grabbed Mandri\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8217\'92s arm to pull him into a squeeze. She caught his eyes, forced him to confront her lilac scent, her pounding heat, her smooth skin, her honeyed, aching lips.}}